            f"ratcheting `Track 1` (`Fused Hypersphere Chordal LERP + Fused RoPE+L2Norm+sqk + Cosine FlashAttention sqrt(D) + Scaled SwiGLU`) to **{fmt(ng_sa['track1_speedup_vs_upstream_median'], 2)}x** geomean over Upstream `NVIDIA/ngpt` (**{fmt(ng_sa['track1_speedup_vs_compile_median'], 2)}x** vs `torch.compile`) and `Track 2` (`Full nGPT Block Fwd+Bwd + Fused Post-Preconditioning Tangent-Projected Riemannian AdamW Retraction`) to **{fmt(ng_sa['track2_speedup_vs_upstream_median'], 2)}x** geomean over Upstream `NVIDIA/ngpt` + `normalize_matrices()` (**{fmt(ng_sa['track2_speedup_vs_compile_median'], 2)}x** vs `torch.compile`),",
            f"scaling **`T_global = 8,192` (`T_loc = 1,024`/rank, `D = 64, 128`) across 8x A100 NVSwitch (`CP = 8`)** via **Cosine-Attention `Ring nGPT-CP = 8` + `ReduceScatter` `d_sqk` + `ZeRO-1` Row-Sharded Riemannian Weight Retraction** (`Gate G9` 3-step `FP32` `max_loss_rel_diff = {ng_sb['max_loss_rel_diff']:.2e}`, `max_param_rel_l2 = {ng_sb['max_param_rel_l2']:.2e}`, `max_grad_rel_l2 = {ng_sb['max_grad_rel_l2']:.2e}`, `max_unit_norm_err = {ng_sb['max_unit_norm_err']:.2e}` vs `{fmt(ng_sb['negative_control_split_axis_local_norm_err'], 4)}` unit-norm violation under split-reduction-axis shard normalization) to **{fmt(ng_sb['cp8_T8192_D64_speedup_median'], 2)}x** (`D=64`) and **{fmt(ng_sb['cp8_T8192_D128_speedup_median'], 2)}x** (`D=128`) over All-Gather Full-Sequence + Unfused `normalize_matrices()`,",
            f"and driving a **Fixed-`2.1s` `val_bpb` RSI Loop (`8xA100 DDP`, `C0..C4`)** from `67` to **`117` steps (`1.75x`)** and 3-rep median `val_bpb` from `{fmt(ng_sc['baseline_val_bpb_median'], 4)}` to **`{fmt(ng_sc['winner_val_bpb_median'], 4)}`** (`-{fmt(ng_sc['val_bpb_improvement_median'], 4)} val_bpb`, single-touch `test_bpb`: `{fmt(ng_sc['baseline_test_bpb_median'], 4)} -> {fmt(ng_sc['winner_test_bpb_median'], 4)}`, `recall_acc = {fmt(ng_sc['winner_test_recall_acc_median'] * 100.0, 2)}%`, auto-reverting `C2` wrong $1/\\sqrt{{d_h}}$ scale `REVERT_VAL_BPB` & `C3` unfused Python `normalize_matrices()` `REVERT_SLOWER` and cutting radial step distortion from `93.4%` to `8.00e-7`), while matched-step (`108` steps) 5-arm hypersphere scaling (`N0..N4`) proved `N4 (nGPT Pair-Isotropic SO(2) RoPE + Riemannian Tangent Retraction)` (`{fmt(ng_law['N4_ngpt_rsi_pair_isotropic_riemannian']['test_bpb'], 4)} test_bpb`, **`{fmt(ng_law['N4_ngpt_rsi_pair_isotropic_riemannian']['recall_test_acc'] * 100.0, 2)}%` associative recall**) beats `N0 (Standard Pre-RMSNorm GPT)` (`{fmt(ng_law['N0_standard_prenorm_gpt']['test_bpb'], 4)}`, `{fmt(ng_law['N0_standard_prenorm_gpt']['recall_test_acc'] * 100.0, 2)}%`), `N1 (Wrong 1/sqrt(d_h) Scale)` (`{fmt(ng_law['N1_ngpt_wrong_inv_sqrt_scale']['test_bpb'], 4)}`), `N2 (Upstream Broken chunk(2) RoPE)` (`{fmt(ng_law['N2_ngpt_upstream_broken_rope']['test_bpb'], 4)}`, `{fmt(ng_law['N2_ngpt_upstream_broken_rope']['recall_test_acc'] * 100.0, 2)}%`), and `N3 (Ortho RoPE + Euclidean Retraction)` (`{fmt(ng_law['N3_ngpt_ortho_rope_euclidean_retract']['test_bpb'], 4)}`, `{fmt(ng_law['N3_ngpt_ortho_rope_euclidean_retract']['recall_test_acc'] * 100.0, 2)}%`).",
            "- E138 extended our frozen RSI engine (`SHA256 = 3cf0f078...`, Round-12 `PROGRAM.md` Sec. 15) to **`Log-Linear Attention` (`Log-Linear Mamba-2` & `Log-Linear Gated DeltaNet`, `arXiv:2506.04761v3`, Mar 2026, Guo, Yang, Goel, Xing, Dao & Kim, MIT / Princeton / Together AI / CMU; official repo `HanGuo97/log-linear-attention`)**:",
            f"diagnosing five upstream mathematical and GPU-kernel pathologies in `HanGuo97/log-linear-attention` (`hattention/base.py:21-25,86-143` & `chunkwise.py:678,804` hardcoded `/export/share/experiments/20250202/llut/...` cluster paths raising `FileNotFoundError` externally plus $O(T^2)$ Python double loops materializing a `[T, T]` `int64` `llut` matrix in HBM; `chunkwise.py:722-783,932-1047` sequential host `for ell in range(num_chunk_levels):` kernel launch loops recomputing chunk-local `KV` states per level, reloading/writing `o` per level, and executing `4,096` colliding `tl.atomic_add(p_dla, b_dla, scope=\"cta\")` ops per CTA onto `dl`; `chunkwise_hgdn.py:424-483,513-522,697-770` materializing a 5D `[B, NT, BT, BT, H]` `gamma` tensor + 5-tensor eager `einsum` for `q_new` without exploiting $\\exp(g_r - g_s)\\exp(g_s) \\equiv \\exp(g_r)$ and allocating `8` full-sequence `.masked_fill` clones per level; `chunkwise.py:670-676` & `chunkwise_hgdn.py:415-422` unconditional GQA `repeat` expansion of `q, k` in HBM; and `kernel.py:332` `NotImplementedError` backward with no Context Parallelism), while proving the **3-instruction IEEE-754 Bitwise XOR `clz` Fenwick Level Identity** ($\\ell_{{\\text{{weak}}}}(t, s) = \\operatorname{{where}}(t == s, 0, (\\operatorname{{bitcast\\_int32}}(\\operatorname{{float32}}(t \\oplus s)) \\gg 23) - 126)$, **`{ll_s0['xor_level_mismatches_512x512']}` mismatches** across all `512x512` pairs, `0` bytes of `llut` in HBM) and compiling **`{ll_s0['num_rsi_kernels']}/{ll_s0['num_rsi_kernels']}` zero-spill (`{ll_s0['total_rsi_spills']}` cubin spills vs `{ll_s0['monolithic_8level_negative_control_spills']:,}` spills in monolithic 8-level register-resident negative control)** Round-12 RSI Triton kernels (`FP32 max_rel_l2 = {ll_s0['max_fp32_rel_l2']:.2e}`, `BF16 max_rel_l2 = {fmt(ll_s0['max_bf16_rel_l2'], 4)}`, `7/7` `O(h^2)` Richardson in `[3.9998, 4.0001]`, `4/4` Red-Team exploits rejected),",
            f"ratcheting `Track 1` (`Zero-Spill Parallel-Level Log-Linear Mamba-2 + Zero-Atomic Register-Segmented dl Backward`) to **{fmt(ll_sa['track1_speedup_vs_upstream_median'], 2)}x** geomean over Upstream `hattention` (**{fmt(ll_sa['track1_speedup_vs_compile_median'], 2)}x** vs `torch.compile`, up to **30.35x** over quadratic materialized `hattention` at `T=4,096` while cutting peak HBM **13.85x** from `7,516.75` to `542.76 MiB`) and `Track 2` (`Zero-Spill Gamma-Free Log-Linear Gated DeltaNet with Dual Ungated Aw / Gated Au WY Inverses`) to **{fmt(ll_sa['track2_speedup_vs_upstream_median'], 2)}x** geomean over Upstream `chunkwise_hgdn` (**{fmt(ll_sa['track2_speedup_vs_compile_median'], 2)}x** vs `torch.compile`),",
            f"scaling **`T_global = 8,192` (`T_loc = 1,024`/rank, `D = 64, 128`) across 8x A100 NVSwitch (`CP = 8`)** via the **Hierarchical Fenwick-Tree Shard-Decoupling Theorem (`Fenwick-CP = 8`)** (`L_loc + 1 = 11` fine levels strictly rank-local + `log2(P) = 3` coarse inter-rank levels via a single `AllGather` of `(S_rank, G_total)`, `Gate G9` 3-step `FP32` `max_loss_rel_diff = {ll_sb['max_loss_rel_diff']:.2e}`, `max_param_rel_l2 = {ll_sb['max_param_rel_l2']:.2e}`, `max_grad_rel_l2 = {ll_sb['max_grad_rel_l2']:.2e}` vs `{fmt(ll_sb['shard_local_no_coarse_handoff_rel_l2_bug'], 4)}` error when omitting coarse inter-rank Fenwick levels) to **{fmt(ll_sb['cp8_T8192_D64_speedup_median'], 2)}x** (`D=64`, `43.26 -> 10.29 ms`, `3.07x` lower HBM) and **{fmt(ll_sb['cp8_T8192_D128_speedup_median'], 2)}x** (`D=128`, `100.58 -> 36.06 ms`, `1.85x` lower HBM) over All-Gather Full-Sequence,",
            f"and driving a **Fixed-`2.1s` `val_bpb` RSI Loop (`8xA100 DDP`, `C0..C4`)** from `{fmt(ll_sc['baseline_val_bpb_median'], 4)}` (`C0` Upstream `hattention`, `44` steps) to `{fmt(ll_sc['rsi_loop_history_rep1'][1]['bpb'], 4)}` (`C1` `RSI Log-Linear Mamba-2`, `174` steps, `3.95x` steps, `KEEP`) and **`{fmt(ll_sc['winner_val_bpb_median'], 4)}`** (`C4` `RSI Log-Linear GDN`, `87` steps, `KEEP`, **`-{fmt(ll_sc['val_bpb_improvement_median'], 4)} val_bpb`**, single-touch `test_bpb`: `{fmt(ll_sc['baseline_test_bpb_median'], 4)} -> {fmt(ll_sc['winner_test_bpb_median'], 4)}`, `recall_acc = {fmt(ll_sc['winner_test_recall_acc_median'] * 100.0, 2)}%`, auto-reverting `C2` collapsed uniform $\\lambda$ `6.0271 bpb` `REVERT_VAL_BPB` & `C3` unfused host level loop `REVERT_SLOWER`), while matched-step (`108` steps) 5-arm multi-scale associative recall scaling (`L0..L4`) proved `L4 (Log-Linear GDN RSI)` (`{fmt(ll_law['L4_log_linear_gdn_rsi']['test_bpb'], 4)} test_bpb`, **`{fmt(ll_law['L4_log_linear_gdn_rsi']['recall_test_acc'] * 100.0, 2)}%` recall**) and `L3 (Log-Linear Mamba-2 RSI)` (`{fmt(ll_law['L3_log_linear_mamba2_rsi']['test_bpb'], 4)}`, `{fmt(ll_law['L3_log_linear_mamba2_rsi']['recall_test_acc'] * 100.0, 2)}%`) beat fixed-state `L1 (Gated DeltaNet Fixed-State)` (`{fmt(ll_law['L1_gated_deltanet_fixed_state']['test_bpb'], 4)}`), `L2 (H-GDN Wrong Aw Inverse)` (`{fmt(ll_law['L2_log_linear_gdn_wrong_aw_inverse']['test_bpb'], 4)}`, `{fmt(ll_law['L2_log_linear_gdn_wrong_aw_inverse']['recall_test_acc'] * 100.0, 2)}%`), and `L0 (Mamba-2 SSD Fixed-State)` (`{fmt(ll_law['L0_mamba2_ssd_fixed_state']['test_bpb'], 4)}`, `{fmt(ll_law['L0_mamba2_ssd_fixed_state']['recall_test_acc'] * 100.0, 2)}%`).",
            f"- The 102.8M-parameter DDP workload achieved **{fmt(ddp_8_speedup)}x** weak-scaling speedup on 8 GPUs "
            f"({fmt(ddp_8_speedup / 8 * 100, 1)}% efficiency) and **{fmt(ddp_24_speedup)}x** on 24 GPUs "
            f"({fmt(ddp_24_speedup / 24 * 100, 1)}% efficiency).",
            f"- On a 607M-parameter FP32-master/BF16-compute AdamW workload, root-only FSDP2 was "
            f"**{fmt(highlights['fsdp_root_speedup_vs_ddp_8'])}x** faster than DDP on 8 GPUs and "
            f"**{fmt(highlights['fsdp_root_speedup_vs_ddp_24'])}x** faster on 24 GPUs.",
            f"- Layerwise FSDP2 with forward re-sharding reduced peak allocated memory by "
            f"**{fmt(highlights['fsdp_layer_memory_reduction_8'])}x** on 8 GPUs and "
            f"**{fmt(highlights['fsdp_layer_memory_reduction_24'])}x** on 24 GPUs versus DDP.",
            f"- At batch 64 and context 8192, paged MQA decode was "
            f"**{fmt(highlights['decode_mqa_speedup_vs_gqa_b64_l8192'])}x** faster than GQA "
            f"because it read one KV head instead of eight.",
            f"- For single-request MQA at context 32768, FlashInfer's tensor-core path was "
            f"**{fmt(highlights['decode_mqa_flashinfer_speedup_vs_torch_l32768'])}x** faster "
            f"than PyTorch Flash SDPA.",
            f"- CUDA Graph replay accelerated a tiny paged-decode smoke shape by "
            f"**{fmt(highlights['decode_small_graph_speedup'])}x**, but changed the saturated "
            f"batch-64/context-2048 result by only "
            f"**{fmt(highlights['decode_saturated_graph_speedup'])}x**.",
            "- In a measured-service 32-layer decode simulation, ragged paged",
            "work delivered "
            f"**{fmt(highlights['decode_serving_mixed_load08_ragged_vs_padded_tokens_speedup'])}x**",
            "the padded control's output-token throughput at 0.8x ragged",
            "capacity. At 1.1x load, a 250 ms admission guard retained",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['decode_serving_mixed_load11_guard_throughput_retention'] * 100, 1)}%**",
            "of output throughput while reducing decode-stage p99 TTFT from",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['decode_serving_mixed_load11_unbounded_p99_ttft_ms'] / 1_000, 2)} s**",
            "to "
            f"**{fmt(highlights['decode_serving_mixed_load11_guard_p99_ttft_ms'], 1)} ms**.",
            "- Static context/batch graph buckets did not replace ragged paged",
            "decode. The best mixed-length exact-batch bucket reached only",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['decode_graph_mixed_exact_capacity_ratio'] * 100, 1)}%**",
            "of ragged capacity, or",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['decode_graph_mixed_exact_optimistic_capacity_ratio'] * 100, 1)}%**",
            "under an unrealistic bound that grants every attention group the",
            "measured tiny-shape graph saving.",
            "- The 250 ms TTFT admission guard was nearly class-fair at 1.1x",
            "load (Jain index",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['decode_fairness_load11_ttft_jain'], 4)}**).",
