            "long-output acceptance to",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['decode_fairness_load11_dual_long_short'] * 100, 1)}%**",
            "of short-output acceptance while retaining",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['decode_fairness_load11_dual_throughput_ratio'] * 100, 1)}%**",
            "of TTFT-guard output throughput.",
            "- In a measured-service prefill/decode model, 1024-token chunks at",
            "0.2x decode-only load cut p99 maximum token gap by",
            f"**{fmt((1.0 - highlights['prefill_none_load02_chunk_1024_prefill_first_p99_max_intertoken_gap_ms'] / highlights['prefill_none_load02_monolithic_prefill_first_p99_max_intertoken_gap_ms']) * 100, 1)}%**",
