            f"**{fmt(highlights['pacing_none_burst_16_f0p9_tenant_equal_actual_service40_gain16_p99_ingress_delay_ms'], 0)} ms**.",
            "- Robust TTFT SLO selection rejected a universal pacing window.",
            "At no-cache 0.4x load, the 650 ms SLO selected",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['slo_pacing_none_load04_burst_4_slo650_requested_pacing_window_ms'], 0)} ms**",
            "for burst-4 but only",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['slo_pacing_none_load04_burst_16_slo650_requested_pacing_window_ms'], 0)} ms**",
            "for burst-16. At 800 ms, the selected burst-16 window increased to",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['slo_pacing_none_load04_burst_16_slo800_requested_pacing_window_ms'], 0)} ms**",
            "and raised throughput",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['slo_pacing_none_load04_burst_16_slo800_throughput_vs_unpaced'], 2)}x**.",
            "- Robust policy compression recovered most oracle throughput with",
            "few keys. At 800 ms, four burst+cache keys retained",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['compression_slo800_robust_burst_cache_mean_throughput_ratio_vs_oracle'] * 100, 1)}% mean**",
            "and",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['compression_slo800_robust_burst_cache_worst_throughput_ratio_vs_oracle'] * 100, 1)}% worst-state**",
            "throughput. Median-tuned full-state lookup appeared",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['compression_slo800_median_full_mean_throughput_ratio_vs_oracle'] * 100, 1)}%**",
