            f"**{fmt(highlights['uncertainty_slo800_naive_full_all_10pct_expected_scenario_slo_violation_fraction'] * 100, 2)}%**",
            "of scenario probability. A one-feature-safe envelope cut this to",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['uncertainty_slo800_hamming1_safe_full_all_10pct_expected_scenario_slo_violation_fraction'] * 100, 2)}%**",
            "while retaining",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['uncertainty_slo800_hamming1_safe_full_all_10pct_mean_expected_throughput_ratio_vs_oracle'] * 100, 1)}%**",
            "mean oracle throughput. Every isolated single-feature error had zero",
            "envelope violations.",
            "- Per-feature confidence recovered most of the static-envelope tax.",
            "At 800 ms with 10% joint error, a 95%-recall/5%-false-alarm",
            "full-state confidence set retained",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['confidence_slo800_full_all_10pct_high_recall_clean_mean_expected_throughput_ratio_vs_oracle'] * 100, 1)}%**",
            "mean oracle throughput and reduced naive scenario violation",
