            f"**{fmt(highlights['confidence_slo800_full_all_10pct_high_recall_clean_expected_scenario_slo_violation_fraction'] * 100, 2)}%**.",
            "Oracle confidence was violation-free at",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['confidence_slo800_full_all_10pct_oracle_mean_expected_throughput_ratio_vs_oracle'] * 100, 1)}%**",
            "throughput.",
            "- Confidence calibration became an explicit SLO requirement.",
            "At 800 ms/10% state error with 5% false alarms, expected",
