            f"**{fmt(highlights['confidence_frontier_slo800_full_all_10pct_fpr5_budget0p001_mistake_flag_sensitivity'] * 100, 1)}% / "
            f"{fmt(highlights['confidence_frontier_slo800_full_all_10pct_fpr5_budget0p0025_mistake_flag_sensitivity'] * 100, 1)}% / "
            f"{fmt(highlights['confidence_frontier_slo800_full_all_10pct_fpr5_budget0p005_mistake_flag_sensitivity'] * 100, 1)}%**",
            "mistake recall. Among named deployable profiles, the full",
            "policy had to fall back to always-flag at the 0.1% budget but",
            "could use 95% recall/5% false alarms at 0.25%.",
            "- Finite monitoring data can dominate deployment readiness.",
            "For the 800 ms full policy at the 0.1% risk budget, actual 99%",
            "recall required",
            f"**{int(highlights['calibration_full800_budget0p001_required_labeled_requests']):,} labeled requests**",
