            f"**{int(highlights['calibration_full800_near_error_required_labeled_requests']):,}**",
            "or",
            f"**{int(highlights['calibration_full800_near_false_alarm_required_labeled_requests']):,}**",
            "labels.",
            "- Anytime-valid repeated monitoring was substantially more",
            "expensive than one-shot certification. The transparent",
            "alpha-spending Hoeffding baseline had a median",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['anytime_overhead_median'], 1)}x**",
