            f"**{int(highlights['anytime_full800_budget0p001_required_labeled_requests']):,}**",
            "labels; detecting a 2.5-point recall breach needed",
            f"**{int(highlights['anytime_drift_slo800_full_mistake_flag_recall_required_requests']):,}**",
            "fresh requests.",
            "- Preregistered geometric checkpoints recovered about half of",
