            f"**{int(highlights['checkpoint_drift_full800_mistake_flag_recall_1p50_required_post_change_requests']):,}**",
            "requests.",
            "- Bernoulli-KL Chernoff bounds removed most of the remaining",
            "checkpoint-monitoring tax. At 1.10x, median certification cost",
            "fell to",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['kl_1p10_cert_vs_hoeffding_median'] * 100, 1)}%**",
