            f"**{fmt(highlights['cross_grid_best_average_maximum_certification_ratio'], 5)}x**/",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['cross_grid_best_average_maximum_drift_ratio'], 5)}x**",
            "worst certification/drift.",
            "- Cadence robustness reversed the nominal schedule frontier.",
            "Worst-over-grid selection made 1.10x the unique winner in",
            f"**{int(highlights['cadence_cert_1p10_robust_winner_count'])}/1,918**",
