            f"**{fmt(highlights['coalescing_depth_drift_16_faster_fraction'] * 100, 2)}%**",
            "of actions, yet its worst profile still regressed",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['coalescing_depth_drift_16_worst_profile']['regression_among_fifo_detected']['fraction'] * 100, 3)}%**.",
            "Depth 64 processed every look and was FIFO-equivalent.",
            "- Exact batched replay preserved every declared look. With zero",
            "marginal snapshot cost it used E78's same launch schedule,",
            "saved",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['coalescing_batch_drift_0_launch_savings_fraction'] * 100, 2)}%**",
            "of launches and",
            f"**{fmt((1.0 - highlights['coalescing_batch_drift_0_service_work_fraction']) * 100, 2)}%**",
            "of modeled service work, accelerated",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['coalescing_batch_drift_0_faster_fraction'] * 100, 2)}%**",
            "of drift actions, and had zero regressions. At just 0.01%",
            "marginal cost, regression was",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['coalescing_batch_drift_0p0001_regression_fraction'] * 100, 4)}%**",
            "but maximum positive delay was only",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['coalescing_batch_drift_0p0001_positive_delay']['maximum_record']['summary']['maximum'], 0)}**",
            "requests.",
            "- Streaming member results strictly improved the exact batch",
            "fence with identical work. FIFO regressions remained zero",
            "through 0.2% marginal snapshot cost while drift actions were",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['coalescing_streaming_drift_0p002_faster_fraction'] * 100, 2)}%**",
            "faster. The first regression at 0.25% was",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['coalescing_streaming_drift_0p0025_regression_fraction'] * 100, 4)}%**",
            "with only",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['coalescing_streaming_drift_0p0025_positive_delay']['weighted_mean_requests'], 2)}/"
            f"{fmt(highlights['coalescing_streaming_drift_0p0025_positive_delay']['maximum_record']['summary']['maximum'], 0)}**",
            "mean/maximum request delay.",
            "- Batch member order shifted the same work frontier. At 1%",
            "marginal cost, newest-first cut drift regression from",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['coalescing_order_drift_0p01_oldest_first_regression_fraction'] * 100, 4)}%**",
            "to",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['coalescing_order_drift_0p01_newest_first_regression_fraction'] * 100, 4)}%**.",
            "Newest-oldest was nearly as safe at",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['coalescing_order_drift_0p01_newest_oldest_regression_fraction'] * 100, 4)}%**",
            "but limited maximum delay to",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['coalescing_order_drift_0p01_newest_oldest_maximum_delay'], 0)}**",
            "rather than",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['coalescing_order_drift_0p01_newest_first_maximum_delay'], 0)}**",
            "requests.",
            f"- Production vLLM Marlin W4A16 accelerated the 4096→32000 vocabulary",
            f"projection by **{fmt(highlights['marlin_vocab_m1_speedup'])}x** at M=1 and",
            f"**{fmt(highlights['marlin_vocab_m32_speedup'])}x** at M=32, but slowed it",
            f"to **{fmt(highlights['marlin_vocab_m512_speedup'])}x** BF16 speed at M=512.",
            f"- vLLM's fused MoE path was **{fmt(highlights['moe_slm_e32_t512_top2_speedup_vs_loop'])}x** "
