            "this comparison isolates grouped scheduling and launch overhead, not every production grouped-GEMM alternative.",
            f"- Hot-expert routing reduced useful fused throughput by "
            f"**{fmt(highlights['moe_slm_e32_t2048_hot_throughput_loss'] * 100, 1)}%** "
