            f"**{fmt(highlights['ep_roundtrip_24_4096_speedup'], 3)}x** at 4096, "
            "with exact sequential-versus-pipelined outputs.",
            f"- At 24 GPUs/4096 tokens per rank, routing 80% of every rank to one "
