            f"**{fmt(highlights['moe_temporal_24_2048_rot1_cycle_ratio'])}x**; "
            f"rotating bias 2 reached **{fmt(highlights['moe_temporal_24_2048_rot2_cycle_ratio'])}x**.",
            f"- In a 24-GPU Latin-square crossover, packing only expert ID and "
