            "   **705.0 MiB** (`5.40 ms`, **5.26x** faster and **11.7x** less",
            "   memory, with **2.70x** lower `dK` relative error via FP32",
            "   online-softmax accumulation).",
            "",
            "## Fused SwiGLU",
            "",
            "Effective GB/s counts two input reads and one output write; eager paths may",
