            f"- **`cuDNN {mm_tb['cudnn_version']}` `Conv3d(2,14,14)` Tubelet Pathology vs `Window-Morton-2x2` Pack + `16`-Aligned `cuBLAS` (`N = {mm_tb['num_patches']}` patches -> `{mm_tb['num_merged_tokens']}` merged tokens):** Both HuggingFace `Qwen2_5_VisionPatchEmbed`'s pre-extracted `[N, 3, 2, 14, 14]` `nn.Conv3d` (**`{fmt(mm_tb['tubelet_modes']['hf_conv3d_preextracted_patches']['ms_median'], 2)} ms`**, `{fmt(mm_tb['tubelet_modes']['hf_conv3d_preextracted_patches']['effective_tflops_median'], 2)} TFLOP/s`) and 5D video `nn.Conv3d` (**`{fmt(mm_tb['tubelet_modes']['conv3d_5d_ncthw_video']['ms_median'], 2)} ms`**, `{fmt(mm_tb['tubelet_modes']['conv3d_5d_ncthw_video']['effective_tflops_median'], 2)} TFLOP/s`) suffer a **`19.4–19.5x` implicit-GEMM pathology** when `kernel_size == stride == [2, 14, 14]` (`K = 1,176`, `1,176 mod 16 = 8`). Our zero-atomic Triton **`Window-Morton-2x2` Ragged Pack/Unpack** (`Frame > 8x8 Window > 2x2 Merger Quad > Patch`, `16`-aligned `K_pad = 1,184`) + `cuBLAS` ran `Fwd + Bwd` in **`{fmt(mm_tb['tubelet_modes']['triton_winmorton2x2_pack_cublas_1184']['ms_median'], 3)} ms` (`{fmt(mm_tb['tubelet_modes']['triton_winmorton2x2_pack_cublas_1184']['effective_tflops_median'], 1)} TFLOP/s`, `{fmt(mm_tb['speedup_triton_pack_over_hf_conv3d'], 2)}x` over HF `Conv3d`, `{fmt(mm_tb['speedup_triton_pack_over_eager_10d'], 2)}x` over eager `10D` permute+swizzle, `out rel_l2 = {mm_tb['parity_vs_conv3d_max']['out_rel_l2']:.2e}`, `dx rel_l2 = 0.0`)**. Keeping patches quad-contiguous enabled a zero-copy Triton `RMSNorm` + `view(N_quad, 5120)` `PatchMerger` (**`{fmt(mm_tb['patch_merger_modes']['quad_contiguous_triton_rmsnorm_merger']['ms_median'], 2)} ms`, `{fmt(mm_tb['patch_merger_modes']['quad_contiguous_triton_rmsnorm_merger']['inc_peak_mib_median'], 1)} MiB`** vs `{fmt(mm_tb['patch_merger_modes']['raster_permute_eager_rmsnorm_merger']['ms_median'], 2)} ms`, `{fmt(mm_tb['patch_merger_modes']['raster_permute_eager_rmsnorm_merger']['inc_peak_mib_median'], 1)} MiB` = **`{fmt(mm_tb['merger_speedup_zero_copy_over_raster'], 2)}x` speedup & `{fmt(mm_tb['merger_mem_saving_ratio'], 2)}x` lower HBM**).",
            f"- **Single-Launch Fused `Q+K` `3D M-RoPE` (`S = {mm_mr['seqlen']}`, `28Q / 4KV, D = 128`):** Both `Qwen2.5-VL` sectioned `[16, 24, 24]` and `Qwen3-VL` interleaved `[24, 20, 20]` reduced identically (`0.0` `FP64` `rel_l2`) to `1D RoPE` on text tokens (`pos_t == pos_h == pos_w`) while running **`{fmt(mm_mr['speedup_triton_sectioned_over_hf_eager'], 2)}x` / `{fmt(mm_mr['speedup_triton_interleaved_over_hf_eager'], 2)}x` faster** (`{fmt(mm_mr['modes']['triton_fused_qk_3d_mrope_sectioned']['ms_median'], 3)}` / `{fmt(mm_mr['modes']['triton_fused_qk_3d_mrope_interleaved']['ms_median'], 3)} ms` vs `{fmt(mm_mr['modes']['hf_eager_3d_mrope']['ms_median'], 3)} ms` HF eager) at **`{fmt(mm_mr['mem_saving_triton_over_hf_eager_ratio'], 2)}x` lower peak HBM** (`256 MiB` vs `484 MiB`; `torch.compile` loop-fused pointwise codegen reached `{fmt(mm_mr['modes']['torch_compile_3d_mrope']['ms_median'], 3)} ms` once warmed).",
