            f"| Suite 0 Upstream `fla/ops/mesa_net` Forensics, Spectral Jacobi-PCG Convergence & `FP64` Oracles | `5` upstream pathologies (`x^(0)=0`, omitted Jacobi preconditioner in `naive.py:111`, `+1e-5` biased denominators stalling 30-step CG at `{mn_s0['spectral_convergence_audit']['upstream_step30_rel_l2']:.3e}`) + monolithic `[64x128]` kernel **`{mn_s0['cubin_spill_audit']['negative_control_monolithic_d128_spills']:,}` spills** | `{mn_s0['cubin_spill_audit']['total_rsi_kernels']}/{mn_s0['cubin_spill_audit']['total_rsi_kernels']}` (`{mn_s0['cubin_spill_audit']['total_specializations']}` specs) **`{mn_s0['cubin_spill_audit']['total_rsi_spills']}`-Spill** Round-13 RSI Kernels | Step-6 PCG error `{mn_s0['spectral_convergence_audit']['rsi_pcg_step6_rel_l2']:.2e}` (**`{fmt(mn_s0['spectral_convergence_audit']['accuracy_improvement_factor_step6_vs_upstream30'], 1)}x`** more accurate in `5.0x` fewer steps), `FP32 rel_l2 = {mn_s0['fp32_max_rel_l2_median']:.2e}`, `BF16 = {fmt(mn_s0['bf16_max_rel_l2_median'], 4)}` | **`{mn_s0['red_team_exploits_caught']}` Red-Team exploits rejected**, `{mn_s0['richardson_oh2_passed']}` `O(h^2)` Richardson in `[3.9958, 4.0004]` | Exact Jacobi diagonal preconditioner $D_t = \\operatorname{{diag}}(H_t + \\Lambda)$, warm start $x^{{(0)}} = D_t^{{-1}} q_t$, unbiased `1e-30` guard, folded `step == 0` matvec |",
            f"| Track 1 Core `MesaNet` Dual-State Layer (`chunk_mesa_net_rsi` Fwd+Bwd across `s1..s4`, `K=V=64/128`) | `A0` Upstream 30-Step CG (`59.24–84.01 ms`, `435.8–1,692.8 MiB`) / `A1` Sequential `torch.linalg.solve` (`755.82–3,038.92 ms`) / `A2` `torch.compile` (`31.40–56.11 ms`) | `A4_rsi_jacobi_pcg6_fast` (`1.20–1.54 ms`, `46.8–161.8 MiB`) & `A3_rsi_jacobi_pcg8_fused` (`1.21–1.59 ms`) | Wins all `4` shapes (`s1..s4`), cuts `T=2,048` peak HBM **`12.24x`** (`1,692.8 -> 138.3 MiB`) | **{fmt(mn_sa['track1_mesa_layer']['geomean_speedup_vs_upstream_median'], 2)}x** vs Upstream `A0` (**{fmt(mn_sa['track1_mesa_layer']['geomean_speedup_vs_compile_median'], 2)}x** vs `torch.compile` `A2`, up to **{fmt(mn_sa['track1_mesa_layer']['max_speedup_vs_seq_linalg_solve_median'], 2)}x** vs `A1`) | Causal Query-Subtiled `BM=16` PCG (`64x64` streamed $H_{{kk}}$ quadrants) + Unified Dual-Gram Adjoint $C_c = dO_c V_c^\\top - d\\tilde{{Q}}_c K_c^\\top$ |",
            f"| Track 2 Full `MesaNetBlock` (`ShortConv1d(W=4) + QK-L2Norm + MesaNet + Fused RMSNorm-SiLU Gate + Projections`, `s1..s4`) | `B0` Upstream `MesaNetBlock` (`61.84–85.09 ms`) / `B2` `torch.compile` (`35.64–58.41 ms`) | `B3_rsi_mesanet_block_pcg6` (`3.59–3.65 ms`) | Wins all `4` shapes (`s1..s4`), `0` cubin spills across all `15` block kernels | **{fmt(mn_sa['track2_mesa_block']['geomean_speedup_vs_upstream_median'], 2)}x** vs Upstream `B0` (**{fmt(mn_sa['track2_mesa_block']['geomean_speedup_vs_compile_median'], 2)}x** vs `torch.compile` `B2`) | Fused 4-tap depthwise causal `ShortConv1d+SiLU`, fused `QK-L2Norm+cumsum(g)`, and fused `RMSNorm-SiLU` output gate |",
            f"| Suite B 8-GPU NVSwitch Dual-State Prefix-Scan `Mesa-CP = 8` (`T_global = 8,192`, `T_loc = 1,024`/rank) | All-Gather Full-Sequence Upstream (`169.73 ms` `D=64`, `3,640.7 MiB` / `225.45 ms` `D=128`, `6,085.4 MiB`) / Local-Only No-Prefix (`{fmt(mn_sb['parity']['broken_local_only_no_prefix_rel_l2'], 4)}` error) | Dual-State Prefix-Scan `Mesa-CP = 8` (`3.06 ms` `D=64`, `278.3 MiB` / `3.08 ms` `D=128`, `334.0 MiB`) | `Gate G9` 3-step `FP32` `loss = {mn_sb['parity']['max_loss_rel_diff']:.2e}`, `param = {mn_sb['parity']['max_param_rel_l2']:.2e}`, `grad = {mn_sb['parity']['max_grad_rel_l2']:.2e}` | **{fmt(mn_sb['performance']['D64']['speedup'], 2)}x** (`D=64`, **`{fmt(mn_sb['performance']['D64']['hbm_reduction_ratio'], 2)}x` less HBM**) & **{fmt(mn_sb['performance']['D128']['speedup'], 2)}x** (`D=128`, **`{fmt(mn_sb['performance']['D128']['hbm_reduction_ratio'], 2)}x` less HBM**) | Parallel associative prefix scan over coupled $(H_{{kk}}^{{\\text{{local}}}}, H_{{kv}}^{{\\text{{local}}}}, G_{{\\text{{total}}}})$ seeds local PCG preconditions and reverse adjoints |",
            f"| Suite C.1 Fixed-`2.1s` `val_bpb` RSI Loop (`8xA100 DDP`, `C0..C4`) | `C0` Upstream 30-Step CG (`36` steps, `{fmt(mn_sc['val_bpb_loop']['initial_val_bpb_median'], 4)} val_bpb`) -> `C1` `RSI 1-Step PCG Scalar Ridge` (`368` steps, `{fmt(mn_sc['val_bpb_loop']['candidates'][1]['val_bpb_median'], 4)} val_bpb`, `KEEP`) | `C4` `RSI MesaNet ShortConv + Anisotropic Lambda + PCG-6` (`344` steps, `{fmt(mn_sc['val_bpb_loop']['final_val_bpb_median'], 4)} val_bpb`, `KEEP`) | Single-touch `test_bpb = {fmt(mn_sc['val_bpb_loop']['final_test_bpb_median'], 4)}`, recall acc **`{fmt(mn_sc['val_bpb_loop']['final_recall_acc_median'] * 100.0, 2)}%`** (`1` test touch) | **`-{fmt(mn_sc['val_bpb_loop']['val_bpb_improvement_median'], 4)} val_bpb`**, **`-{fmt(mn_sc['val_bpb_loop']['test_bpb_improvement_median'], 4)} test_bpb`** | Auto-reverts `C2` (`0-CG Hebbian GLA collapse`, `5.9547 bpb`, `2.95%` acc `REVERT_VAL_BPB`) & `C3` (`unfused 35-CG host loop` `REVERT_SLOWER`) |",
            f"| Suite C.2 Matched-Step (`108`) 5-Arm Correlated-Key Overwrite Associative Recall Scaling Law | `M0` `Hebbian GLA 0-CG` (`{fmt(mn_law['M0_hebbian_gla_0cg']['test_bpb_median'], 4)}`, `{fmt(mn_law['M0_hebbian_gla_0cg']['recall_test_acc_median'] * 100.0, 2)}%`) / `M2` `Biased 1-CG` (`{fmt(mn_law['M2_mesa_biased_unprecond_1cg']['test_bpb_median'], 4)}`) / `M1` `Online 1-Step DeltaNet` (`{fmt(mn_law['M1_online_deltanet_1step']['test_bpb_median'], 4)}`) / `M3` `Scalar Lambda PCG` (`{fmt(mn_law['M3_mesa_scalar_lambda_pcg']['test_bpb_median'], 4)}`, `{fmt(mn_law['M3_mesa_scalar_lambda_pcg']['recall_test_acc_median'] * 100.0, 2)}%`) | `M4` `MesaNet Anisotropic ShortConv RSI PCG-6` (`{fmt(mn_law['M4_mesa_anisotropic_shortconv_rsi_pcg']['test_bpb_median'], 4)} test_bpb`, `recall_test_bpb = {fmt(mn_law['M4_mesa_anisotropic_shortconv_rsi_pcg']['recall_test_bpb_median'], 4)}`) | Recall acc **`{fmt(mn_law['M4_mesa_anisotropic_shortconv_rsi_pcg']['recall_test_acc_median'] * 100.0, 2)}%`** vs `{fmt(mn_law['M0_hebbian_gla_0cg']['recall_test_acc_median'] * 100.0, 2)}%` (`M0`) and `{fmt(mn_law['M3_mesa_scalar_lambda_pcg']['recall_test_acc_median'] * 100.0, 2)}%` (`M3`) | **`-{fmt(mn_law['M0_hebbian_gla_0cg']['test_bpb_median'] - mn_law['M4_mesa_anisotropic_shortconv_rsi_pcg']['test_bpb_median'], 4)} bpb`** vs `M0` (**`-{fmt(mn_law['M1_online_deltanet_1step']['test_bpb_median'] - mn_law['M4_mesa_anisotropic_shortconv_rsi_pcg']['test_bpb_median'], 4)} bpb`** vs `M1`, **`-{fmt(mn_law['M3_mesa_scalar_lambda_pcg']['test_bpb_median'] - mn_law['M4_mesa_anisotropic_shortconv_rsi_pcg']['test_bpb_median'], 4)} bpb`** vs `M3`) | Locally optimal $(H_t + \\Lambda)^{{-1}} q_t$ whitens correlated key common modes and adapts $\\Lambda_{{h,d}}$ per channel |",
            "",
            "**Key E139 takeaways:**",
            "",
            "1. **Why Upstream `fla/ops/mesa_net` Stalls at `1.29e-3` After 30 CG Steps — and How Warm-Start Jacobi-PCG Reaches `4.85e-8` in 6 Steps (`26,672x` Higher Accuracy, `53.51x` Track 1 Speedup):**",
            "   In official `fla/ops/mesa_net/chunk_cg_solver_fwd.py` and `chunk_cg_solver_bwd.py`, the CG solver initializes $x^{(0)} = 0$, leaves the Jacobi diagonal preconditioner commented out (`fla/ops/mesa_net/naive.py:111`), and adds a large `+ 1e-5` bias to both $\\alpha_k = \\langle r, z\\rangle / (\\langle p, q_p\\rangle + 10^{-5})$ and $\\beta_k = \\langle r_{\\text{new}}, z_{\\text{new}}\\rangle / (\\langle r, z\\rangle + 10^{-5})$. Whenever the residual norm $\\|r_k\\|_2$ drops below $10^{-2}$ (so $\\|r_k\\|_2^2 < 10^{-4}$), the `+ 1e-5` denominator bias corrupts CG search-direction conjugacy and stalls relative L2 error at **`1.294e-3` even after 30 iterations**. Constructing the exact causal diagonal preconditioner $D_{c,i,d} = \\exp(\\bar{g}_{c,i})(H_{c-1})_{d,d} + \\sum_{j \\le i} M_c[i,j] k_{c,j,d}^2 + \\Lambda_d$ in registers, warm-starting at $x^{(0)} = D_{c,i}^{-1} q_{c,i}$, and using an unbiased `1e-30` underflow guard achieves **`8.29e-6` relative L2 error in 4 steps** and **`4.85e-8` in 6 steps** (`26,672x` more accurate in `5.0x` fewer iterations), cutting single-GPU layer time from `59.24–84.01 ms` to **`1.20–1.54 ms` (`53.51x` geomean speedup over Upstream, `31.91x` over `torch.compile`, and up to `2,482.58x` over sequential `torch.linalg.solve`)**.",
            "2. **Causal Query-Subtiled `BM = 16` PCG + Unified Dual-Gram Adjoint Eliminate `1,942` SM80 Register Spills (`0` Spills Across All `15/15` Kernels):**",
            "   At head dimension $K = V = 128$ (`BT = 64`), holding `[128, 128]` state tiles (`16,384` floats) alongside `[64, 128]` `FP32` CG vectors `(x, r, z, p, Ap)` simultaneously in registers causes **`1,942` cubin spills** in the monolithic negative-control kernel. Folding the warm-start matvec $A(x^{(0)})$ into `step == 0` of a single runtime loop `for step in range(MAX_CG_STEPS + 1):`, subtiling queries at `BM = 16` (`4` query subtiles per `BT = 64` chunk) while streaming the four `[64, 64]` quadrants of $H_{kk}$ one tile at a time, and unifying the two-pass intra-chunk backward (`chunk_h_kv_bwd_intra` + `chunk_h_kk_bwd_intra`) into the single **Unified Dual-Gram Adjoint** $C_c = dO_c V_c^\\top - d\\tilde{Q}_c K_c^\\top$, $F_c = (Q^*_c K_c^\\top \\odot C_c) \\odot M_c$ with token-subtiled `BK = 32` reductions achieves **`0` cubin spills across all `15/15` Round-13 RSI kernels (`49` specializations)**.",
            "3. **8-GPU NVSwitch Dual-State Prefix-Scan `Mesa-CP = 8` & Locally Optimal Second-Order Test-Time Training (`55.38x–73.17x` CP=8 Speedup, `99.02%` Recall Accuracy):**",
            "   Unlike standard linear attention (where only $H_{kv}$ crosses shard boundaries), `MesaNet` couples two recurrent matrix states $(H_{kk}, H_{kv})$ where $H_{kk}^{\\text{prefix}}(r)$ enters nonlinearly inside the local matrix inverse $(H_{kk}^{\\text{prefix}}(r)\\exp(\\bar{g}_{c,i}) + H_{kk}^{\\text{local}} + \\Lambda)^{-1} q_{c,i}$ (omitting prefix states causes `114.5%` relative L2 error). All-gathering per-rank summary tuples $(H_{kk}^{\\text{total}}(r), H_{kv}^{\\text{total}}(r), G_{\\text{total}}(r))$ over NVSwitch (`256 KiB/rank` at $D=128$) to seed both the forward local PCG preconditioner and reverse inter-rank adjoint scan achieves **`1.19e-7` 3-step `FP32` loss parity (`9.39e-7` parameter parity)** with **`55.38x` (`D=64`, `13.08x` less HBM) and `73.17x` (`D=128`, `18.22x` less HBM)** speedup over All-Gather Full-Sequence. On correlated-key overwrite associative recall, first-order Hebbian (`M0: 5.9654 test_bpb, 3.47% acc`) and 1-step gradient descent (`M1: 5.3852 test_bpb, 8.69% acc`) collapse under common-mode key interference, whereas Round-13 RSI `MesaNet` (`M4`) reaches **`0.0859 test_bpb` (`97.58%` 108-step accuracy; `0.0466 val_bpb` / `0.0549 test_bpb` / `99.02%` accuracy in the `2.1s` `8xA100 DDP` loop)**.",
            "",
            "## `Kimi Linear: An Expressive, Efficient Attention Architecture — Kimi Delta Attention (KDA)` (`arXiv:2510.26692`, Moonshot AI / Kimi Team, `fla-org/flash-linear-attention/tree/main/fla/ops/kda`) Round-14 RSI Overflow-Free Causal Sub-Chunking, Zero-Spill Split-`K`/`V` WY Adjoint & 8-GPU NVSwitch Channel-Affine Monoid `KDA-CP = 8` (E140)",
