            f"| Suite B 8-GPU NVSwitch Channel-Affine Monoid `KDA-CP = 8` (`T_global = 8,192`, `T_loc = 1,024`/rank) | All-Gather Full-Sequence (`231.83 ms` `D=64`, `8,505.7 MiB` / `258.21 ms` `D=128`, `16,901.7 MiB`) / Omitted Handoff (`{fmt(kda_sb['omitted_handoff_rel_l2_error'], 4)}` error) | Channel-Affine Monoid `KDA-CP = 8` (`7.26 ms` `D=64`, `124.0 MiB` / `7.35 ms` `D=128`, `172.6 MiB`) | `Gate G9` 3-step `FP32` `loss = {kda_sb['max_loss_rel_diff']:.2e}`, `param = {kda_sb['max_param_rel_l2']:.2e}`, `grad = {kda_sb['max_grad_rel_l2']:.2e}` | **{fmt(kda_sb['performance'][0]['speedup_vs_allgather'], 2)}x** (`D=64`, **`{fmt(kda_sb['performance'][0]['hbm_reduction_vs_allgather'], 2)}x` less HBM**) & **{fmt(kda_sb['performance'][1]['speedup_vs_allgather'], 2)}x** (`D=128`, **`{fmt(kda_sb['performance'][1]['hbm_reduction_vs_allgather'], 2)}x` less HBM**) | Composes $P_c = \\operatorname{{Diag}}(e^{{\\bar{{g}}_{{c,B_T}}}}) - J_c^\\top W_c$ and $H_c = J_c^\\top U_c$; reuses $P_{{\\text{{rank}}}}^\\top$ in backward (`2x` smaller payload) |",
