            f"| Track 1 Core Generalized `DPLR` Layer (`chunk_dplr_rsi` Fwd+Bwd across `s1..s4`, `K=V=64/128`) | Upstream Spill (`53.19–125.37 ms`, `2,954.3–11,704.3 MiB`) / Eager Chunk (`53.69–122.81 ms`) / `torch.compile` (`42.26–117.72 ms`) / Sequential Recurrent (`1,517.18–3,089.95 ms`) | `chunk_dplr_rsi` (`1.64–4.81 ms`, `184.6–593.5 MiB`) | Wins all `4` shapes (`s1..s4`), cuts `s4` peak HBM **`19.72x`** (`11,704.3 -> 593.5 MiB`) | **{fmt(rw7_sa['track1_geomean_speedup_vs_upstream_spill'], 2)}x** vs Upstream Spill (**{fmt(rw7_sa['track1_geomean_speedup_vs_torch_compile'], 2)}x** vs `torch.compile`, **{fmt(rw7_sa['track1_geomean_speedup_vs_recurrent'], 2)}x** vs Recurrent) | Fused `gi/ge` cumsum, $16 \\times 16$ boundary-anchored sub-chunk `Aqk, Aqb, Aak, Aab`, Split-`K`/`V` WY backward, L2-staged dual-source state scan |",
